# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules

# The built window is not committed: it is 365 kB of bundle that changes on
# every edit to the web, and a repository whose diffs are mostly minified
# JavaScript is one nobody reads the diffs of. `make ui` writes it, and CI
# writes it before it builds or releases.
#
# dist/.keep is committed all the same, so that go:embed has a directory to
# find and `go build ./...` works on a fresh clone. See ui/embed.go.
dist/*
!dist/.keep
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
